message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "revit-model-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for Autodesk Revit"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that gives AI agents
  controlled access to live Autodesk Revit models, with read-only operation,
  dry-run previews and one undo entry per change.
authors:
